docs {
  # Send OTP (Email)

  **Method:** `POST`
  **Endpoint:** `/api/v1/auth/otp/send`
  **Auth:** None

  ## Description

  Dispatches a one-time verification code (OTP) to the specified email address. Protected by CaptchaGuard when captcha is enabled.

  ## Request

  ### Headers

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `X-Captcha-ID` | `string` | Conditional | Captcha challenge ID (required when `CAPTCHA_ENABLED=true`) |
  | `X-Captcha-Code` | `string` | Conditional | Solved captcha answer (required when `CAPTCHA_ENABLED=true`) |

  ### Body

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `identifier` | `string` | Yes | Target recipient email address |
  | `type` | `string` | Yes | Verification type, must be `email` |

  ## Response

  **`200 OK`**
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "identifier": "user@doratou.local",
      "type": "email",
      "expires_at": "2026-10-25T21:46:00Z"
    }
  }
  ```

  ## Errors

  * `400 Bad Request` — Invalid input, unsupported type, or missing captcha headers
  * `429 Too Many Requests` — Rate limit exceeded
}
